{
  "dn19:0.1": "Dīgha Nikāya 19 ",
  "dn19:0.2": "Mahāgovindasutta ",
  "dn19:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "dn19:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati gijjhakūṭe pabbate. ",
  "dn19:1.3": "Atha kho pañcasikho gandhabbaputto abhikkantāya rattiyā abhikkantavaṇṇo kevalakappaṁ gijjhakūṭaṁ pabbataṁ obhāsetvā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ aṭṭhāsi. Ekamantaṁ ṭhito kho pañcasikho gandhabbaputto bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "dn19:1.4": "“yaṁ kho me, bhante, devānaṁ tāvatiṁsānaṁ sammukhā sutaṁ sammukhā paṭiggahitaṁ, ārocemi taṁ bhagavato”ti. ",
  "dn19:1.5": "“Ārocehi me tvaṁ, pañcasikhā”ti bhagavā avoca. ",
  "dn19:2.0": "1. Devasabhā ",
  "dn19:2.1": "“Purimāni, bhante, divasāni purimatarāni tadahuposathe pannarase pavāraṇāya puṇṇāya puṇṇamāya rattiyā kevalakappā ca devā tāvatiṁsā sudhammāyaṁ sabhāyaṁ sannisinnā honti sannipatitā; ",
  "dn19:2.2": "mahatī ca dibbaparisā samantato nisinnā honti, cattāro ca mahārājāno catuddisā nisinnā honti; ",
  "dn19:2.3": "puratthimāya disāya dhataraṭṭho mahārājā pacchimābhimukho nisinno hoti deve purakkhatvā; ",
  "dn19:2.4": "dakkhiṇāya disāya virūḷhako mahārājā uttarābhimukho nisinno hoti deve purakkhatvā; ",
  "dn19:2.5": "pacchimāya disāya virūpakkho mahārājā puratthābhimukho nisinno hoti deve purakkhatvā; ",
  "dn19:2.6": "uttarāya disāya vessavaṇo mahār�